# Expression-layer builtins inside a lambda.
#
# For each group: first + last + (max - min) + the sum of the two leading
# values. The result is a list, rendered like the interpreter renders lists.
#
#   domain examples/08_builtins.domain
#   Expected output: [122, 1100]
Cursed Energy: 08_builtins.input
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n\n"
Cursed Technique: Split Each by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert Each List to Integers
Cursed Technique: Map Each
    Using: (g) -> first(g) + last(g) + max(g) - min(g) + sum(take(g, 2))
Reveal: stdout
